                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1a8b5a5-67b2-47bb-ad62-24067d912d93",
                                                "sense_id": "4c50996e-0342-37d2-ad23-d0fcbe2b176c",
                                                "text": "On the Big Island, for example, many samll. farming operations depend on unpaid labor such as 'woofers', to fulfill their labour needs cheaply. Woofers are those who labour on organic farms within the World Organization of Organic Farms (WOOF) Network."
                                            }
